{"sources":{"odeon":{"ok":true,"films":[{"title":"Rammstein - Live in Mexico City","lang":"DE","genre":["Musik"],"dauer":116,"fsk":"10+","text":"Die Industrial-Metal-Fans in Mexiko-Stadt sind mit vollem Einsatz dabei – sie singen, schreien, springen und kennen dabei jeden Ton. Die sechsköpfige deutsche Band Rammstein versammelt rund 65.000 Fans im Foro So mitten in der mexikanischen Millionenmetropole und Hauptstadt, wo die brachiale Musik offenbar auf fruchtbaren Boden fällt.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61933/rammposter.webp?v=1793639138%2C0.5198%2C0.103","trailer":"https://youtu.be/9x-dFyLxfBQ","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/rammstein-live-in-mexico-city","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-14","time":"20:45"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-15","time":"19:45"}]},{"title":"Shaun das Schaf - Spuk im Kürbisfeld","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Animation"],"dauer":80,"fsk":"0+","text":"Auf der Mossy Bottom Farm laufen die Vorbereitungen für Halloween auf Hochtouren. Die Vorfreude der Schafherde wird jedoch jäh getrübt, als der tollpatschige Farmer versehentlich das Kürbisbeet zerstört. Entschlossen, das Fest doch noch zu retten, sucht Shaun nach einer Lösung und greift dabei zu ungewöhnlichen Mitteln.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/shaun.webp?v=1790695157%2C0.4954%2C0.7366","trailer":"https://youtu.be/_dk7a5t7t-o","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/shaun-das-schaf-spuk-im-kürbisfeld","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-12","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-13","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-14","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-15","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-17","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Emil und die Detektive","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer"],"dauer":100,"fsk":"0+","text":"Für Emil (Nicholas Jonah Peter) beginnen die Sommerferien mit einer Zugfahrt nach Berlin, wo er seine Großmutter Renate Tischbein (Ursula Werner) besuchen will. Noch unterwegs wird ihm jedoch das Geld von dem Betrüger Max Grundeis (Merlin Sandmeyer) gestohlen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61865/GER-EMIL-Poster2764x4096.webp?v=1792594814%2C0.4706%2C0.2115","trailer":"https://youtu.be/wXsh-55i4GI","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/emil-und-die-detektive","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-12","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-13","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-14","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-15","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Der perfekte Urlaub","lang":"DE","genre":["Komödie"],"dauer":117,"fsk":"6+","text":"Leo (Elyas M'Barek), Pepe (Florian David Fitz), Rocco (Wotan Wilke Möhring) und Simon (Frederick Lau) wollen auf Mallorca Abstand von den Ereignissen der vergangenen Zeit gewinnen. Seit dem eskalierten Handy-Spiel ist ihre Freundschaft schwer belastet.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61894/31065.webp?v=1792474501%2C0.4853%2C0.3324","trailer":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Ay4YQX0iiY","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/der-perfekte-urlaub","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-12","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-13","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-14","time":"18:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-15","time":"17:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-17","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Other Mommy","lang":"DE","genre":["Horror"],"dauer":94,"fsk":"14+","text":"Für die kleine Bela (Arabella Olivia Clark) ist ihre Mutter (Jessica Chastain) der wichtigste Mensch in ihrem Leben. Doch nach und nach wächst in ihr der Verdacht, dass von der Person, der sie am meisten vertraut, eine unheimliche Gefahr ausgeht. Je stärker sich fortan ihre Ängste verdichten, desto mehr gerät auch ihr Gefühl von Sicherheit ins Wanken.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/61936/OtherMommy-Teaser-A4-RGB-dt_NEU.webp?v=1793140523","trailer":"https://youtu.be/5Mn1Be5hSZc","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/other-mommy","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-14","time":"20:45"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-15","time":"19:45"}]},{"title":"Se domani non torno","lang":"IT","genre":["Drama"],"dauer":106,"fsk":"0+","text":"Gino Cecchettin è un padre vedovo con tre figli che accudisce con amore, in sostituzione della moglie: Elena, Giulia e Davide. La prima vive già fuori casa, la seconda sta per laurearsi in ingegneria biomedica, il terzo è ancora minorenne. La notte in cui Giulia non torna a casa senza avvisare, cosa non da lei, Gino comincia a preoccuparsi, soprattutto dopo che scopre che lei era in compagnia del ragazzo che aveva da poco lasciato.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/se-domani.webp?v=1794332881","trailer":"https://youtu.be/_3ggsnabhfw","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/se-domani-non-torno","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-12","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-13","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-14","time":"18:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-15","time":"17:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-18","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"La città dei vivi","lang":"IT","genre":["Drama"],"dauer":96,"fsk":"10+","text":"In una Roma di periferia, Luca ha ventitré anni ma è ancora alle prese con la scuola serale per prendere il diploma, oltre ad aiutare il padre accompagnandolo sul furgone con cui lavora. Tra la ricerca di un impiego più solido e la reticenza allo studio, il giovane non ha ancora chiaro cosa fare della sua vita anche se pianifica il futuro con la fidanzata Marta Gaia, che è di casa nell'appartamento in cui Luca vive con i genitori.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/la-città-dei-vivi.webp?v=1794333134","trailer":"https://youtu.be/Y-0Hs73X23Q","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/la-città-dei-vivi","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-17","time":"18:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-17","time":"20:30"}]}],"soon":[{"title":"Avengers 5: Doomsday","lang":"DE","release":"","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/avengers.webp?v=1786294375","trailer":"https://youtu.be/GKVUZvWk6Aw?si=LB8vkd1C2g-Gl-Qz"},{"title":"Dune 3","lang":"DE","release":"","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/dune.webp?v=1786294638","trailer":"https://youtu.be/txhL-x8uE-Q?si=bx9MAhRDaU3OUAI7"}],"fetched":"2026-11-12T19:52:51Z"},"stella":{"ok":true,"films":[{"title":"SHAUN DAS SCHAF - SPUK IM KÜRBISFELD","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Familie","Kinder"],"dauer":80,"fsk":"","text":"Auf der Mossy Bottom Farm laufen die Vorbereitungen für Halloween auf Hochtouren. Die Vorfreude der Schafherde wird jedoch jäh getrübt, als der tollpatschige Farmer versehentlich das Kürbisbeet zerstört. Entschlossen, das Fest doch noch zu retten, sucht Shaun nach einer Lösung und greift dabei zu ungewöhnlichen Mitteln.","poster":"https://www.stellakino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/60877/sss.webp?v=1790629392","trailer":"https://youtu.be/_dk7a5t7t-o?si=CwfCpsGlSqUbiqqM","url":"https://www.stellakino.com/de/programm/shaun-das-schaf-spuk-im-kürbisfeld","shows":[{"ort":"Brixen","date":"2026-11-14","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Brixen","date":"2026-11-15","time":"14:00"}]},{"title":"DER PERFEKTE URLAUB","lang":"DE","genre":["Komödie"],"dauer":117,"fsk":"","text":"Leo (Elyas M'Barek), Pepe (Florian David Fitz), Rocco (W